/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store

# The site's generated files: built by site/build.sh from the sources above.
site/kite_playground.wasm
site/reference/
site/docs/
site/SPECIFICATION.md
site/README.md
site/demo/

# The rendered package manifests: written by packaging/render.sh from a
# release's own checksums. The ones in the tree keep their placeholders so they
# stay reviewable; these are release artefacts.
packaging/out/

# Wrangler's local state, not the site.
.wrangler/
